### Tawseela API — auth examples (Spring Boot 2.7, Java 8)
### Default server: http://localhost:8099
### With SMS disabled, OTP codes are logged: "OTP ... for user ... purpose REGISTER"

@base = http://localhost:8099

### Register (CUSTOMER or DRIVER). DRIVER requires vehicleType, vehicleNumber, licenseNumber.
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ada",
  "lastName": "Lovelace",
  "mobileNumber": "+15550001111",
  "password": "Str0ng!Pass",
  "confirmPassword": "Str0ng!Pass",
  "role": "CUSTOMER"
}

### Verify registration OTP (copy 6-digit code from logs if SMS off)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "+15550001111",
  "otpCode": "1234"
}

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "+15550001111",
  "password": "Str0ng!Pass"
}

### Refresh token
POST {{base}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Logout (requires Bearer access token + body refresh token)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Forgot password — send OTP
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "+15550001111"
}

### Forgot password — verify OTP (returns resetToken)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "+15550001111",
  "otpCode": "1234"
}

### Forgot password — reset (use resetToken from previous step)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/forgot-password/reset
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobileNumber": "+15550001111",
  "resetToken": "PASTE_RESET_TOKEN_UUID",
  "newPassword": "N3w!Str0ng",
  "confirmPassword": "N3w!Str0ng"
}

### Current user (all roles)
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Update driver vehicle profile
PATCH {{base}}/api/auth/me/driver-profile
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleType": "SUV",
  "vehicleNumber": "XYZ-9999",
  "licenseNumber": "DL-111222"
}

### Admin (default mobile admin — set TAWSEELA_ADMIN_DEFAULT_PASSWORD in prod)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_ACCESS_TOKEN
